Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 21:32:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 24/24] Test index promotion and fresh-engine log syncs under
 the decisions

IndexPromotionDurability_Tests: the index-order promotion on a log that
cannot sync publishes the new format without durable commits (default
A); with them the promotion's journal barrier is refused, the open falls
back to read-only, the row reads, writes throw naming the refusal, and
both files stay byte for byte (decisions 2 and 3).
FreshEngineLogSync_Tests: the engines that write while the log cannot
sync opt out of durable commits, so the scenarios reach the same files
as before (with durable commits those writes now fail loudly).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UFnsmor6qyZMSd1VoKwfJh
